# McCoy, Not a Bricklayer: "Creatures you control with counters on them have lifelink" (CR 613.1f, 702.15a) grants
# lifelink only to its controller's creatures. Bot2's Dockworker Drone enters with a +1/+1 counter (2/2) and attacks on
# turn 4 for 2: no lifelink, so Bot2 stays at 18 after Bot1's Memnite hits for 2. Bot1's Memnite, countered by McCoy on
# turn 3, does have lifelink - Bot1 gains 2 back to 20. A static that reached every creature would put Bot2 at 20; one
# that missed Bot1's own creatures would leave Bot1 at 18.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Memnite
McCoy, Not a Bricklayer
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Plains
Dockworker Drone
Island x17

